        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/e274bd/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-16T14:12:35.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>How many heroes did you fight him with? My second game ever (with a team where 4 of the 5 were first-timers too) was against Spite with 5, so with a bunch of people not knowing the heroes having to discard 3 a turn, it was super brutal.</p>",
