      {
        "id": 59942,
        "name": "flamethrower49",
        "username": "flamethrower49",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/838e76/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-16T14:24:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It's my personal opinion that Spite should be one of the last villains \"new\" players face.&nbsp; (\"New\", because after facing 17 villains, you're probably not all that new anymore.)&nbsp; Not because he's hard or complicated or boring, though these are all criticisms that have been leveled against him.&nbsp; He should be faced last because he subverts everything people know about the game.&nbsp; You have to have experience with the game to appreciate how he turns it around.&nbsp; A completely new player facing Spite is going to be like, \"What's the point of this game?\" and maybe never play it again.</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:35:51.924Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
